zeus: the recovery half of upstream Adreno740 1c9029b (0f150e6, "Integrate qualified Adreno740 runtime changes", UniXNU 8542980),
on 54b41b8 + patches/adreno740 0001-0004. recover() takes the SMMU fault status: a faulted job is retired even when a ring
switch stranded work, the replay starts after the completed prefix, the recovery log records the fault bit, and GpuTraceRecovery (70)
is traced. Left out on purpose: 1c9029b's NativeAdrenoVm change, which drops importedUntouched() (the skip of per-submission cache
maintenance for GPU-written imports, "about 60 ms per frame"). hangCheck keeps 0004's faulted argument.

